## 1. Successor purpose

This R2 successor replaces no frozen Phase 5D contract. It responds only to the
three blockers in the R1 independent review of the object-only decision
package:

1. replacement Git objects are disabled;
2. the exact runner and scanner are review subjects; and
3. root ownership, receipt creation, temporary-result creation, and finalizer
   paths are implemented as fail-closed executable rules.

The original R1 package and its BLOCK review remain historical immutable
evidence. Creation or review of this v0.2 package does not invoke its runner,
Git, VCPToolBox, a worktree, a Host method, or a runtime.

