## 5. Preconditions for the Jenn decision surface

Before Section 6 A may be consumed:

1. the R2 manifest must bind the seven R2 subjects, R1 historical bytes, and
   all frozen boundary inputs;
2. the runner, scanner, fixture, builder, and validator must reproduce their
   deterministic synthetic evidence;
3. the fresh full atomic independent review must report PASS_NO_BLOCKER; and
4. the active governance projection must still show no actual object-only run
   has occurred.

Without all four conditions, Section 6 A is ineligible and no command may be
run.

## 6. Jenn decision surface

